WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
PHPAML: one platform, zero environment setup.

00:05.000 --> 00:13.000
The published PHPAML CLI package is downloaded and verified.

00:13.000 --> 00:22.000
AML creates a declarative View application and installs its components.

00:22.000 --> 00:29.000
Project diagnostics pass, then the local development server starts.

00:29.000 --> 00:36.000
The generated AML View application opens and runs successfully.
